        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "74b28fec-930d-5059-bdc1-9757d8b1083e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lancaster, Lancashire, England, Peel, Isle of Man\n- Organizations: Lancaster Cathedral, Peel Cathedral, Roman Catholic Diocese of Lancaster\n- People: Vernon Nicholls\n- Roles: Dean\n- Topics: cathedral status, parish churches, rebranding\n\nFacts:\n- Peel Cathedral was built in 1879–84 in Peel, Isle of Man.\n- Lancaster Cathedral was a Roman Catholic parish church until 1924, when it was elevated to cathedral status.\n- Vernon Nicholls became Dean of the newly created Peel Cathedral from 1980.\n- Lancaster Cathedral, also called The Cathedral Church of St Peter and Saint Peter's Cathedral, is on St Peter's Road in Lancaster, Lancashire, England.\n- Peel Cathedral, also called The Cathedral Church of Saint German and rebranded as Cathedral Isle of Man, is located in Peel, Isle of Man.\n- Peel Cathedral is also one of the parish churches in the parish of the West Coast, which includes the town of Peel.\n- The Roman Catholic Diocese of Lancaster is a Latin Rite Roman Catholic diocese centered on Lancaster Cathedral in Lancaster, Lancashire, England.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "0137a451-f3d4-519a-987e-09ba6106c852",
        "text": "Page: Lancaster Cathedral. Sentence: Lancaster Cathedral, also known as The Cathedral Church of St Peter and Saint Peter's Cathedral, is in St Peter's Road, Lancaster, Lancashire, England.\nPage: Lancaster Cathedral. Sentence: It was a Roman Catholic parish church until 1924, when it was elevated to the status of a cathedral.\nPage: Peel Cathedral. Sentence: The Cathedral Church of Saint German or Peel Cathedral, rebranded as Cathedral Isle of Man is located in Peel, Isle of Man.\nPage: Peel Cathedral. Sentence: The cathedral is also one of the parish churches in the parish of the West Coast which includes the town of Peel, and was built in 1879–84.\nPage: Roman Catholic Diocese of Lancaster. Sentence: The Roman Catholic Diocese of Lancaster is a Latin Rite Roman Catholic diocese centred on Lancaster Cathedral in the city of Lancaster in Lancashire, England.\nPage: Vernon Nicholls. Sentence: From 1980 he was also Dean of the newly created Peel Cathedral.",
